{"id":"afddf8e62e2b3b86","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-ml-integral-test.md","title":"ML 随机点上有效积分检验有限","display":"thm-ml-integral-test — ML 随机点上有效积分检验有限","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-ml-integral-test","aliases":["43-thm-ml-integral-test"],"display":"thm-ml-integral-test — ML 随机点上有效积分检验有限","depends_on":["[[43-df-mlrandom]]","[[43-df-integral-test]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"本次笔记内推导；未作为原书定理编号核验","source_scope":"local-supplement","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-ml-integral-test"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-ml-integral-test</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ml-integral-test — ML 随机点上有效积分检验有限"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b5fa7491a43dc01c\" href=\"?note=b5fa7491a43dc01c\" title=\"43-df-integral-test\">43-df-integral-test</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"本次笔记内推导；未作为原书定理编号核验"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"local-supplement"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t:2^\\omega\\to[0,+\\infty]\">\\(t:2^\\omega\\to[0,+\\infty]\\)</span>；随机性与积分检验见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b5fa7491a43dc01c\" href=\"?note=b5fa7491a43dc01c\" title=\"43-df-integral-test\">43-df-integral-test</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MLRandom}(X)\\land\\operatorname{IntegralTest}(t)\\Rightarrow t(X)&lt;\\infty.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{MLRandom}(X)\\land\\operatorname{IntegralTest}(t)\\Rightarrow t(X)&lt;\\infty.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本地证明：取整数c使∫t≤2<sup>c，U_n={Y:t(Y)&gt;2</sup>{n+c}}统一有效开且由Markov界测度≤2^{-n}。若t(X)=∞，则X失败该ML检验。c不必从t有效求出；固定有限常数可以写入枚举程序。</p>\n<p>来源：本次笔记内推导；未作为原书定理编号核验。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地补充另行注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"0586e0fd0301d605","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-mlrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-integral-test","status":"resolved","id":"b5fa7491a43dc01c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-integral-test]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"0586e0fd0301d605","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$，$t:2^\\omega\\to[0,+\\infty]$；随机性与积分检验见 [[43-df-mlrandom]]、[[43-df-integral-test]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-integral-test","status":"resolved","id":"b5fa7491a43dc01c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$，$t:2^\\omega\\to[0,+\\infty]$；随机性与积分检验见 [[43-df-mlrandom]]、[[43-df-integral-test]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"t:2^\\omega\\to[0,+\\infty]","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MLRandom}(X)\\land\\operatorname{IntegralTest}(t)\\Rightarrow t(X)<\\infty.","display":true}],"bytes":1235,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-217","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-ml-integral-test]] — ML 随机点上有效积分检验有限"},{"id":"856834e1c94138dc","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"令 t(Y)=∑ₙ|fₙ₊₁(Y)−fₙ(Y)|。统一计算的连续函数列使 t 下半可计算，非负积分的单调收敛给出积分有限。[[43-thm-ml-integral-test]] 推出 t(X)<∞，故 fₙ(X) 是实数 Cauchy 列并有有限极限。"}],"outgoing":["0586e0fd0301d605","b5fa7491a43dc01c"]}